<title>UK: LIFFE cocoa turns up with NY on grinds, coffee up.</title>
<headline>LIFFE cocoa turns up with NY on grinds, coffee up.</headline>
<text>
<p>COCOA - Turns slightly up with NY on 20.74-pct rise in U.S. Q1 grinds vs forecasts of flat to up 5.0 pct. At 1320 GMT, July up 1 at 1,040.</p>
<p>COFFEE - Up with NY's gains. July up $20 to $1,663.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Nearbys slip, backs firm. Aug dominates volume. Aug down</p>
<p>20 cents at $306.10.</p>
</text>
